  "decision": "Use existing QSystemTrayIcon/contextMenu and canonical QAction callbacks. Set only process-local KSNI_NO_DBUSMENU=1 so KDE renders its platform menu in the Lay process. One application QObject filter keeps nonexclusive checkboxes open in both source and KDE platform QMenu; normal commands/radio/dismissal remain Qt-owned. Save each checkbox immediately,coalesce config application until all menus close;one existing runtime_control(restart) per menu interaction. Explicit service stop cancels pending application.",
  "first_failed_transition": "Actual Qt5.15.3 loads KDEPlasmaPlatformTheme/KF5Notifications5.92,not generic Qt DBus tray. Even contextMenu(None) leaves native SNI /MenuBar and KDE default menu;source QMenu subclass is bypassed by platform projections.",
